Rule 11 (trailing dimension of replacement tensor must match input tensor or be 1 for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 then shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1
