>>
Rule 13 (all replacement tensors must have ranks less than or equal to input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≤ ndim(v_1) ∧ ndim(v_3) ≤ ndim(v_1)
